  "menuPrinciplesAndRankings": "Principles and rankings",
  "menuMusIsPlayedInTeamsOf2WithA": "Mus is played in teams of 2, with a Spanish deck of 40 cards, over 3 rounds of 40 points (40 tantto or 8 hamarreko), unless an exception applies.",
  "menuRankingsAreCalculatedAsFollows3RoundsWon1": "Rankings are calculated as follows: 3 rounds won = 1 win.",
